  "summary": "The 'Big Flipper Board' from the author of ESP32 Marauder: a maximalist Flipper add-on carrying an ESP32-C5 for dual-band Wi-Fi, two separate CC1101 radios individually tuned for the 400 MHz and 900 MHz bands, an nRF24 with PA and LNA, GPS and a microSD slot, with five SMA connectors on the edge. It is the most radio-dense Flipper add-on board that is actually a designed product rather than a generic import.",
